*   Last Modified : 2026-07-20                                             *
*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Restores the native UIMenuIconWnd in the 2025-07-16    *
*                   Ragexe, redirects its textures to uirenewal/menuicon,  *
*                   and reflows the stock child controls over the          *
*                   425x322 renewal panel. The native dispatcher, click,   *
*                   hover, notification, and open/close behavior remain    *
*                   intact. The collapsed-state hit test follows the       *
*                   relocated MENU child instead of the stock (0,0)        *
*                   assumption. Button visibility remains controlled by    *
*                   Hide/Show Buttons (New UI). The 428x333 parent is      *
*                   anchored ten pixels from the bottom-right. QJS-only.   *
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

